{"id":"nenavist_","lemma":"ненависть","pos":"noun","rank":2252,"glosses":["hatred, hate"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"ненависти","plural":"ненависти"},"examples":[{"text":"Ненависть — наш враг.","en":"Hatred is our enemy.","words":[null,{"g":"our, ours"},{"g":"enemy, foe"}]},{"text":"От любви до ненависти один шаг.","en":"There is a fine line between love and hate.","words":[{"g":"from"},{"g":"love","l":"любовь"},{"g":"until / before"},null,{"g":"one"},{"g":"step"}]},{"text":"Ненависть порождает ненависть.","en":"Hatred breeds hatred.","words":[null,null,null]},{"text":"Любовь и ненависть идут рука об руку.","en":"Love and hate go hand in hand.","words":[{"g":"love"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"hand in hand"]]},{"text":"Я не испытываю к себе ненависти.","en":"I don't hate myself.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to try","l":"испытывать"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},null]}]}